Algorithm

This software implements the Dark sectioning algorithm of
  Cao, R. et al. "Dark-based optical sectioning assists background removal in
  fluorescence microscopy." Nature Methods 22, 1299-1310 (2025),
whose reference implementation (MATLAB, Fiji plugin) is published by its authors at
  https://github.com/Cao-ruijie/Dark-sectioning
That repository carries no LICENSE file. Its README states: "We claim an
Apache liscence for Dark sectioning." (github.com/Cao-ruijie/Dark-sectioning,
commit f131db3badb669e02fdb994517d120a867f69f3b of 2025-10-12, README.md blob
3e58a28ce2fcc380f3ae316cb46d47d421fe8aed; retrieved 2026-09-16.)

darksec/upstream_ref.py is an independent NumPy implementation of the published
algorithm, written to reproduce the documented behaviour of that reference
implementation; darksec/core.py implements the same algorithm for CuPy with the
changes documented in README.md. Nothing from the reference repository (code,
Fiji plugin, example images) is redistributed here.

The dark channel prior itself is from
  He, K., Sun, J. & Tang, X. "Single Image Haze Removal Using Dark Channel Prior."
  IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence 33, 2341-2353 (2011).

